Popsicle 3.0.0

This package contains a vendored and adapted Riverpod 2.6.1 engine under
lib/src/engine and lib/src/flutter_engine. Riverpod is licensed under the MIT
License. The original copyright and license text are retained in LICENSE.

Popsicle-specific public APIs include:
- Popsicle.inject / Popsicle.value / Popsicle.create / Popsicle.params
- Scope.get / Scope.use
- Dependency / ReactiveValue
- Store / IntentStore
- Store and ReactiveValue .view() projections
- dedicated Store effect channel
- AsyncState / Async.combine2/3/4
- PopsicleWidget / PopsicleBuilder / PopsicleConsumer
- PopsicleContainer testing and Dart-only helpers

Popsicle preserves upstream attribution while presenting its own public API and
project documentation.
